## Frequently asked questions

### How do I reset my password?

Open the app, tap Sign In, then tap "Forgot password". You will receive an email from contact.aigniteconsulting.ai with a reset link. The link expires after one hour.

### How do I delete my account?

Open Settings in the app, then tap "Delete account". Your data is purged within thirty days. Active subscriptions are cancelled at the end of the current billing period.

### How do I cancel my subscription?

Cancel through the App Store or Google Play subscription settings on your device. The subscription stays active until the end of the current period.

### Why are push notifications not working?

Open iOS Settings or Android Settings, find {{PROJECT_NAME}}, and confirm notification permission is granted. In the app, open Settings and confirm your topic subscriptions are correct.

